  data: {
    LLM: "Focus on collecting the required contract cards before melding. Use jokers wisely - they are valuable for scoring but essential for completing difficult contracts.\n\nTime your initial meld - going down early lets you play off on others' melds, but waiting may let you go out in one turn. Watch what cards opponents are collecting. Save high cards for playing on others' melds rather than being stuck with them.\n\nTrack which cards have been played to estimate what opponents hold. In later rounds, prioritize completing your contract over minimizing score - being stuck with unmelded cards is worse than a few penalty points. Manipulate jokers in escaleras to create more play opportunities.",
    Player: "Focus on collecting the required contract cards before melding. Use jokers wisely - they are valuable for scoring but essential for completing difficult contracts.\n\nTime your initial meld - going down early lets you play off on others' melds, but waiting may let you go out in one turn. Watch what cards opponents are collecting. Save high cards for playing on others' melds rather than being stuck with them.\n\nTrack which cards have been played to estimate what opponents hold. In later rounds, prioritize completing your contract over minimizing score - being stuck with unmelded cards is worse than a few penalty points. Manipulate jokers in escaleras to create more play opportunities.",
